{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:40 2026-10-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:40 2026-10-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:40 2026-10-01 HKT</p><p>今日（10月1日）是國慶77周年，特區政府在早上於舉行升旗儀式，隨後有國慶酒會。</p><p>升旗儀式於上午8時在灣仔香港會議展覽中心外的金紫荊廣場舉行，社會賢達及制服團隊成員出席儀式，現場不設公眾觀禮區。</p><img alt=\"國慶77周年升旗禮於金紫荊廣場舉行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0422e0c8b8cc2061b433b49ad8cf238f/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261001_082216779.jpg\"/><img alt=\"特首李家超等人出席。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab17800eada8d9898c66cb0f9c587398/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261001_082216779_02.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d1b7a332dca709a18cc3f8b41a913ab/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261001_082216779_04.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a1efe34e43cdb68288c1d93558a20ff2/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261001_082216779_05.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f5072ac0e4c3ee8687addef9a71d4a10/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261001_082216779_07.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d72e377ec47491d90275d35f8806292a/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261001_082216779_08.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e20d40feef850d7f494abf8d892d24e2/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261001_082216779_11.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5393b95dc1b7d0dc9f57b4ff277be857/2026-10/KakaoTalk_20261001_082216779_10.jpg\"/><p>行政長官李家超、全國政協副主席梁振英、中聯辦主任周霽、前行政長官林鄭月娥、曾蔭權與政府高層官員、立法會主席李慧琼等人出席升旗禮。李家超伉儷於早上7時51分到場，升旗儀式準時在8時開始。</p><p>記者：郭詠欣</p><p>攝影：陳浩元</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T00:39:33.577401+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":287,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}